# NanoBanana UI

When user asks to beautify UI / make moodboards / hero or marketing visuals:

1. Use **nanobanana-mcp** if available (`set_aspect_ratio` first, then `gemini_generate_image`).
2. Prefer `flash` for drafts, `pro` for final polish (`set_model`).
3. Save under `frontend/public/generated/` when assets ship with the app.
4. Do **not** invent place photos — real Places photos stay from Google API.
5. Match existing JapanTrip visual language (sea/ink/ember; no purple-default AI look).
6. If MCP offline, fall back to Cursor `GenerateImage` or CSS-only polish; say which path used.
